-- Speedy Sales Portal: search terms from Speedy's own service and project pages (speedycon.com): bridge modification,
-- underwater deconstruction, large-diameter and deep coring, reinforced concrete removal, scanning before cutting, column and
-- bascule bridge work, dams, equipment installs that need penetrations, warehouse, airport, school and utility work.
-- Generated by scripts/gen_discovery_seed.mjs --terms-upsert. Terms a manager has edited are not changed.
on conflict (label) do update set pattern = excluded.pattern, kind = excluded.kind, weight = excluded.weight, services = excluded.services,
  category = excluded.category, updated_at = now()
where public.service_terms.updated_by is null;   -- terms a manager edited are left alone
